sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as You
    participant App as uv run mail-assistant
    participant Auth as gmail_client/auth.py
    participant G as Google OAuth
    participant W as Mail watcher
    participant TC as Triage cron
    participant C as Report cron
    participant API as FastAPI

    U->>App: start
    App->>W: thread
    App->>TC: thread
    App->>C: thread
    App->>API: uvicorn on API_PORT
    W->>Auth: load_credentials()  (serialised by a lock)
    alt token.json valid for all scopes
        Auth-->>W: credentials
    else missing or narrower scopes
        Auth->>G: browser consent for mail + calendar.events
        U->>G: approve
        G-->>Auth: token, saved to token.json
    end
    W->>W: IMAP login (XOAUTH2), cursor from data/mail_check_state.json or MAIL_BACKFILL_DAYS
    TC->>TC: every TRIAGE_INTERVAL_SECONDS, triage stored pending mail
    C->>Auth: load_credentials() (cached)
    C->>C: first overview (skipped when nothing changed)
    Note over U: uv run mail-assistant-auth clears the token and runs the consent on its own.
